{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0acebc9417a73526609a996f6b52d98cbec16559340a74d471e3a7b00c2e8b56", "ja": "（今日は、このみさんが初めて劇場のステージに立つ。\nなんだか少し、緊張するな）", "zh": "（今天木实即将首次登上剧场的舞台表演。\n有点令人紧张啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "a37d1f489d38e7c8dca41cc69a632ad2049bc4a6a388c01c7b918deeefe7d84d", "ja": "うう……だ、大丈夫。\n絶対に、だ、大丈夫なんだから……。", "zh": "呜呜……没、没问题。\n一定、没、没问题的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1002_p", "source_sha256": "fb7af182d2ee956ffec7ea0cdf99d1e87e16d16fbc78531f101ce18f6a3ae3ad", "ja": "あれ、このみさん？\nこんなところで何を？", "zh": "咦？木实？\n你在这里做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "e5fe094e77704fcf84b19a505caafd0bf70c976c08982082e2d5164932ccc77e", "ja": "ひゃぁっ！？\nもう、{$P$}！　脅かさないで！", "zh": "呀啊！？\n真是的，{$P$}！别吓我啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5a096b3ad148889879b5baba54dc63598277a781646a53ebb9b68cf24dad2938", "ja": "す、すみません。\nでも、こんなに早くスタンバイしなくても……？", "zh": "抱、抱歉。\n不过，你也不用那么早就站定位吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "9123618e0512e0c2ba0d5a3dfb1d6842f7fbadb216fbe96a632f8415100e979f", "ja": "スタンバイしてたわけじゃないのよ……。いざ、\n本番が近づいてきたら、何だか緊張してきちゃって。", "zh": "我不是在准备就位……而是，\n随着正式演出越来越接近，我不禁紧张起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "d4f3799e058c1b4d68a0ca0f729692a1d6da627883f9ed3a24ad69eb9db4e3ce", "ja": "それで、ちょっとステージの様子を見に来たら……\nなんだかすごく盛り上がってるじゃない？", "zh": "于是我才过来看看舞台的情形……\n看来气氛似乎很热烈呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "0539882ee03804b2076f52b55b9b8799ef11569b021fdcb62c90050a958128e3", "ja": "ううっ、ど、どうしよう。\nますます緊張してきちゃったわ……！", "zh": "呜呜，怎、怎么办？\n我越来越紧张了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1008_p", "source_sha256": "5da01b8eb0519192ed512b3db7ac680abd685af5868ac58f4c4c05797d7973ac", "ja": "こ、このみさん。\n一度深呼吸して、落ち着きましょう。", "zh": "木、木实。\n你先深呼吸一下，冷静下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "aa659706bbcf78f0f2edd26cee242fd3744b44d16c19675d107dafc7cdc38ed3", "ja": "そ、そうね。すー、はー、すー、はー……。\nよ、よよよ、よし大丈夫、もも、もう平気よ！", "zh": "也、也是。（吸气──吐气──吸气──吐气──）\n很、很很很、很好没问题，我我、我已经没事了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1010_p", "source_sha256": "fecdd60c729a2b5bb3b9328321781162ff9aaef4cd7f29719e981e65153b5e6c", "ja": "あまり平気じゃなさそうですね……。", "zh": "但你看起来不像没事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "522799fba4162262cf3c8b56858af758d198f4514e229d8f8f581650da644567", "ja": "平気だってば！\nちょっと声が痙攣してるだけよ！", "zh": "我说没事就是没事！\n只是声音有点抖罢了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "106774de0d9fd0cfbe2b733f1857a66f064d28fa4836438934bc6c6ef5d23c32", "ja": "さあ、私と{$P$}で、\n観客のみんなを、興奮の渦に巻き込むわよ！", "zh": "好啦，{$P$}，我们一起\n让全场观众陷入疯狂吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1b6cdb30b412c8c81c78f861a64576329fd33ad556cf6324d34cc47b4ccbe5d7", "ja": "い、いやいや。\n俺はアイドルじゃないので、ステージには出ませんよ。", "zh": "不、不对不对。\n我不是偶像，不会跟你上场啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "8e361c259a4419b63a2a3c963cb8a81f364f81d173095c0c69e5866d1c4144b9", "ja": "そ、そうだったわね……。\nあ！　でも、そうしない？", "zh": "我、我都忘了……\n啊！还是干脆就这么办呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1015_p", "source_sha256": "cf784dc8488275797d57732539b88ede2514867c53e9f09c9da31fe5111a0ae5", "ja": "は？", "zh": "什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "97968268357dd9d1bcc333a496fb44710958dc0b3b901302815b2fb8d2cb6051", "ja": "私ばっかり緊張してるなんて、悔しいじゃない。\nこうなったら{$P$}も、一蓮托生よ！", "zh": "只有我感到紧张，太不公平了。既然如此，\n{$P$}，我们要同生共死！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "a08f8443993a8ecfd3164bd05c1276350c24f7dca8b32b080e4102c6b91275a8", "ja": "一緒にステージに出て、観客の前で歌いましょう！\n死なばもろとも……！", "zh": "一起登上舞台，唱歌给观众听吧！\n要死一起死……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1018_p", "source_sha256": "98241e8b14c9a8dcacd22ee1b8a2d2b22ce48d68efb54b487bbaef06aecd826c", "ja": "だ、ダメですよ！　お客さんは、アイドルを見に\n来てるんです。俺じゃありませんから。", "zh": "不、不行啊！观众是来看偶像的。\n不是来看我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1019_039kon", "source_sha256": "f9778a6669ea31e3c1ee0293ecd643abf979d821eaeb1e8c15614258c58a0105", "ja": "わ、わかってるわよ。\nちょっと冗談を言ってみただけ……。はあ。", "zh": "这、这我当然知道啊。\n我只是开个玩笑罢了……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "ded50123672efe953a24a47203025ba8b9f82cd1200387f5b548a22514ecadd5", "ja": "アイドルって、やっぱり大変よね。\nつい勢いで、なるなんて言っちゃったけど。", "zh": "当偶像真的很辛苦呢。\n虽然是我自己当时顺口答应的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1021_p", "source_sha256": "52304cb22d034e8dc975eff08b37cc949a2c08192ead63103a642100817a6784", "ja": "……後悔してるんですか？", "zh": "……你后悔了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1022_039kon", "source_sha256": "74a3765b55f88e14a342d4dcc3397bd492f08755d83a7285f4656288f9796c4c", "ja": "どうかしら。\n不安なのは間違いないけど、でも……。", "zh": "我也不确定。\n我确实感到很不安没错，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "3b717c144375907f3d3d51ac3a8149d3c09183240b8cfb4fc1d07dd9b689597c", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}。\nどうして私を誘ってくれたの？", "zh": "{$P$}，我问你哦。\n为什么你会邀请我当偶像呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1024_p", "source_sha256": "41cd635f3e3138c64d3d8b36060dd4c5832d81d55409eadb0a2e933d6d6a514d", "ja": "どうしてでしょうね。\n直感ですから、俺にもよくわかりませんけど。", "zh": "到底是为什么呢？\n那是出于直觉，我自己也不大清楚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1025_p", "source_sha256": "c240be950e01bb4d624b036b5ac0de782d7379aa6ff00687b4947ccba06cc22d", "ja": "でも、きっと目に浮かんだんだと思います。", "zh": "不过，我觉得当时的我眼前一定浮现了一个景象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1026_p", "source_sha256": "86928576c400713c6b65b10c0e5a8df4bf43247bf3a3a24e259f5d1eda8e82b6", "ja": "満場の喝さいを浴びて、ステージで輝く、\nこのみさんの姿が。", "zh": "那就是木实在舞台上发光发热，\n环绕在满场喝采之中的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1027_039kon", "source_sha256": "f22e0b0f02652b73241e7ffa6cff29b2f9ad95e9ac155fdec06fd42c0ac0391c", "ja": "ふうん……。", "zh": "哦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1028_039kon", "source_sha256": "c516acbaa8fe2a24a087eda1c3784a16f265f80d55242cef14f0391a4ff0de20", "ja": "ダメね。私には、まだその景色が、目に\n浮かばないみたい。だから緊張するんだろうけど。", "zh": "不行，我现在似乎还想像不出那样的景象。\n所以才会这么紧张吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1029_p", "source_sha256": "8e3bf244b4644c436508aa078c0a02e072b8fbbe42716c90b952ec9a4484f88e", "ja": "このみさん……。", "zh": "木实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1030_039kon", "source_sha256": "9abca359d44e6b285d19c3da65495f66a2a738d5ee489f331e341458e741ff44", "ja": "でも……だったら、自分で見るまでよね！", "zh": "不过……既然想像不出来，我只好亲自去看看了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1031_039kon", "source_sha256": "ad2ba542a8ac69e00220d0622cdb57c359fa3421c5af07c0f11b109333272660", "ja": "{$P$}にだけ見えるなんて、\nそんなの、なんだかズルいじゃない？", "zh": "怎么可以只让{$P$}看见呢？\n这样子太不公平了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1032_p", "source_sha256": "c308ce73738ff2ae9ac963054e8eeda97d3ce180b3a9f42f190ae3c95e502a16", "ja": "ええ！\nその通りだと思います！", "zh": "是啊！\n你说得对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1033_039kon", "source_sha256": "c32d8bf1a9b7d383188ddfb87e6d6b6fb7340913e9cc8a7f4d5ebb9010479ac8", "ja": "フフッ。話してたら、何だか落ち着いてきちゃった。\nありがと、{$P$}！", "zh": "呵呵。和你聊聊之后，好像冷静下来了。\n谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1034_039kon", "source_sha256": "3ec58ccd9b077a7810cf576afad8d61c94b5bc32fe1c748bb4b56420f959287b", "ja": "お姉さんも、少しはいいとこ見せなくちゃ。\nウフフ♪", "zh": "身为大姊姊，也该露两手让你瞧瞧。\n呵呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1035_039kon", "source_sha256": "7ffa937f0fefa7d8869f6374077f97eb91cf283a60687578a1b3e1237d3c8248", "ja": "それじゃ、行ってくるわね！\n私のセクシーのお披露目よ！", "zh": "好，我要出发啰！\n要向观众展现我的性感！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_039kon_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_003_1036_p", "source_sha256": "e20dc8f372f044d25795237bab3a588c5553bae851287a99cf5e6803d719aef4", "ja": "（このみさん、調子を取り戻したみたいだ！\n今日のステージ、きっと大きな話題になるぞ……！）", "zh": "（木实似乎恢复正常了！\n今天的表演一定会造成轰动……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
